formula for banker: ???


gameplay order:
        start of game - all case values are on the board and contestent chooses what case they want
        round 1 - They pick six cases to open and reveal the values of. These values are removed from the board. 
                After all cases in the round are revealed, the banker makes an offer to buy the contestants case and
                they decide deal or no deal.
        round 2 - They pick five cases to open and reveal the values of. These values are removed from the board. 
                After all cases in the round are revealed, the banker makes an offer to buy the contestants case and
                they decide deal or no deal.
        round 3 - They pick four cases to open and reveal the values of. These values are removed from the board. 
                After all cases in the round are revealed, the banker makes an offer to buy the contestants case and
                they decide deal or no deal.
        round 4 - They pick three cases to open and reveal the values of. These values are removed from the board. 
                After all cases in the round are revealed, the banker makes an offer to buy the contestants case and
                they decide deal or no deal.
        round 5 - They pick two cases to open and reveal the values of. These values are removed from the board. 
                After all cases in the round are revealed, the banker makes an offer to buy the contestants case and
                they decide deal or no deal.
        round 6 and after - They pick one case to open and reveal the value of. this value is removed from the board. 
                After the case in the round is revealed, the banker makes an offer to buy the contestants case and
                they decide deal or no deal.
        deal: if the contestant says deal at any point, they take the money the banker offered and the game finishes
        no deal: The game continues until there are 2 cases left
        end of game: If the contestant gets down to two cases, they get to decide if they take the origional case they took or the other.